Subject: [PATCH] agent: preserve association ownership and clock on metrics updates

Periodic link-metrics snapshots have no authoritative association clock.
Copying them over the live station reset association age to zero, making the
controller reject valid positive-age samples as belonging to a previous
association. Preserve the established association state, elapsed age and
monotonic start while updating metrics. Do not relax exact-owner or
pre-association sample checks, and do not infer ownership from telemetry.

Upstream-Status: Pending

